/P 119 0 R
/E (Our curriculum is designed to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical applications, ensuring that students are well-prepared for the challenges of the modern tech landscape. With state-of-the-art laboratories, experienced faculty, and strong industry collaborations, we aim to nurture future-ready professionals who can contribute to technological advancements and digital transformation. We encourage our students to engage in research, hackathons, industry projects, and internships to gain real-world experience. Our focus on holistic development ensures that graduates not only have technical proficiency but also the leadership and ethical values needed to thrive in the ever-evolving IT sector)
