/Title (The Buddha Institute of Management \(BIM\), under Buddha Group of Institutions, successfully organized its Convocation Ceremony on 2 March 2026. The ceremony was a proud moment for the graduating students as they received their degrees in the presence of distinguished guests and faculty members. The Chairman, Mr. R. A. Aggarwal, attended the ceremony as the chief guest. He distributed degrees to the graduating students and congratulated them on their achievements. In his address, he encouraged students to work hard, remain dedicated to their goals, and contribute positively to society and their professional fields)
